# Product listing rules

Full rulebook: `data/PRODUCT-LISTING-RULEBOOK.md`

## Source of truth

- Catalogue: `data/psp-catalog.csv`
- After CSV edits: `npm run sync-catalog` then `npm run build` if shipping `docs/`

## IDs & categories

- `kn-*` KindNesta packaging · `gg-*` Globgrid apparel · `bh-*` partner home/personal-care
- Categories: `hangtags|hangers|packaging|bags|polybags|stationery|labels|trims|apparel|home|personal-care`
- Never duplicate `id`

## Copy

- Specific claims only — no generic eco/green/sustainable without proof
- Placeholder images: “Illustrative AI-generated packshot until supplier photography is available.”

## Images

| Prefix | Path |
| --- | --- |
| `kn-` | `/images/products/kn/{id}.png` |
| `gg-` | `/images/products/apparel/{id}.png` |
| `bh-` | `/images/products/home/{id}.png` |

- AI-generated packshot PNGs for `gg-*` / `bh-*` via `npm run generate-lineup-images`
- **Never** publish original range sheets, PDF crops, or `crops/` folders. Use AI packshots matching kn-* style instead of SVG templates.

## Kindness Score

- Bands: 80–100 Strong · 50–79 Good · 0–49 Fair
- Gate Fail → max 49; `scoreVerified=FALSE` until certs reviewed
